<title>JAPAN: Chisan-Tokan - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Chisan-Tokan - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 16.07		vs	   16.35</p>
<p> Operating	  167    million	  vs	   57    million</p>
<p> Current     loss 139    million	  vs   loss 396    million</p>
<p> Net	   loss 162    million	  vs   loss 417    million</p>
<p> EPS	     loss 3.35 yen	  vs     loss 8.60 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     48 million	  vs	  48 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Chisan-Tokan Co Ltd is a property developer belonging to the Chisan group.</p>
